# Picked up by `docker build -f platform/worker/Dockerfile .` (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile). The context is the
# repository root, which holds gigabytes of assets and models: send only the
# platform sources and the shared schema.
*
!platform
!src/db

platform/node_modules
platform/.next
platform/.data
platform/public
platform/var
platform/.env*
platform/*.tsbuildinfo
platform/scripts/fixtures
